  "duration_s": 506.666667,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "上集说到四十三岁的彭桓武乡亲，一眼看上了山东姑娘。刘秉贤，他给姑娘写了封信，先表达心意，然后话锋一转，开始列缺点。我不会做饭，不会洗衣服，不懂人情世故，对金钱权利全没兴趣，这哪是表白，这分明是劝退我，一般姑娘早吓跑了。可刘秉贤很快回答回了信几句话，让彭黄武这个一辈子跟物理公式打交道的人红了眼眶。你不会洗衣服，我会你不会做饭，我做你不懂人情世故，我懂你对权力金钱没兴趣，我也没有你不会的，我来你不爱的，我陪你躲认识两个月，两人闪婚。这年，彭黄武、四十三岁、刘炳贤三十六、六岁，婚后的彭黄武相变了个人。以前邋里邋遢，现在衣服整洁了。以前泡实验室不回家，现在知道往家跑了。刘秉贤包揽所有生活琐事，让他毫无后顾之忧，全心扎进国防科研。这一过就是十九年十九年里，他把彭怀武照顾的干干净净体体面面，他在外面撑起国家的核保护伞。他在家里撑起他的一片天可红颜薄命。十九年后，刘秉贤骤然离世，彭黄武躺在床上，整整七天七夜不吃不喝。七天后，他爬起来干了三件事，第一把妻子照片挂床头，一睁眼就要看到第二把妻子骨灰藏花盆，深处，不许任何人碰。第三，从此一个人住，不允许任何人搬进来打扰。这一首就是三十年。三十年啊，一个生活不能自理的人，妻子走后，自己做饭，自己洗衣，自己打理一切。七十六岁，开始学做饭，常常饭烧糊汤煮肝，可从来不请保姆，也不让人帮忙。有人劝他找个人照顾，他摇摇头，这是我们两个人的世界。第三个人进来就不一样了。他时常对着一张白纸，跟妻子说话，写着写着就写成了一本书。你说这得有多深的感情，才能让一个老人守着一盆骨灰一张照片过三十年。但彭黄武的很远不止于此。一九九五年，他获得禾梁合力基金科学与技术成就奖，奖金一百万港币，九零年代的一百万。什么概念？一笔巨款啊，当时他身患多种疾病，有人劝他拿着钱治病吧，身体要紧。彭欢武怎么说的这钱对我没用处，然后拿着一百万港币全部捐赠了出去。设立彭黄武纪念赠款，从一九九六年到二零零四年九年间，分批赠给三十五位。当年一起搞两弹身体受过伤害或生活困难的老同事，别人拿奖金奖励后人，他拿奖金回报同代人。他说，原子弹是集体的功劳，奖金也是集体的轻飘飘。一句话，一百万的港币一分都没留，晚年的彭桓武干了件更让人看不懂的事，他要把自己在人间的痕迹全部擦掉，推掉各种社会头衔，谢绝各级领导接见，不坐专车，不请保姆，公交车上没人认得出这老头是谁？两弹一星功勋奖章捐给中国人民革命军事博物馆、毕生工资积蓄近五十万元，捐给中科院，理论物理研究所全部藏书捐给研究所图书馆。去世前，他列了张清单，家里的一本书、一把椅子、一台电脑、一个打印机，甚至上网号码都一一备注了，该归还到哪里，最后连遗体也捐了捐给医院。用于医学研究。二零零七年二月二十八日二十一时四十分，九十二岁的彭黄武在北京逝世。他留下的遗嘱，每一个字都戳人心窝丧遗从简，不举行任何会骨灰不存。任何公墓要与妻子刘炳贤的骨灰合并规范，自然不要墓碑，不要公墓，不要纪念，只求和妻子的骨灰混在一在一起，洒向大自然。他来的时候一无所有，走的时候两袖清风，把自己的一切全部捐给了这个国家。最后连骨灰都要和最爱的人一起回归，这片他守护了一生的土地。如今，他的名字被刻在天上。中国科学院国家天文台发现的小行星国际永久编号四八七九八被命名为彭循环五行。他什么都没留下，只留下了天上的一颗星和戈壁滩上，那朵永远铭刻在中华民族记忆里的蘑菇云。朋友们，记住这个名字吧。滕黄武，一个能让氢弹爆炸生活却不能自理的两弹元群，一个对国家倾尽所有，对妻子忠贞一生的纯粹的人。这束花，我们替十四亿人送给他。彭欢武的故事讲完了，但你知道吗？像他这样隐姓埋名，为国助盾的人，远不止一个钱学森，冲破美国五年封锁，毅然回国。程开甲扎根戈壁，二十八年无人知晓，林巧志一生结生了五万多个孩子，却自己没当过母亲。这些人才是我们真正该追的星。如果你想把这些故事完整的读一遍，我推荐你看看这本书。国之几两。他由环球人物杂志社主编收录了三十多位科学界功勋人物的真实人生，从两弹一星到航天农业，从钱学森到袁隆平，每一位的故事都像彭桓武这样戳人心窝，书里还有大量珍贵的历史老照片和院士亲笔语录。不是那种干巴巴的人物传记，是真的能让你读着读着就红了眼眶的那种自己读是一份敬意。给孩子读是一种传承，让咱们的下一代知道什么叫真正的英雄。什么叫国之脊梁？这本书就在左下角链接里，感兴趣的朋友可以带回去一本，细细品读，点个赞，收藏起来，评论区留一句，致敬朋友，再转发给身边的人，关注我。下一期继续讲那些隐姓埋名为国筑盾的无双国事。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00001",
      "start_ms": 130,
      "end_ms": 4110,
      "text": "上集说到四十三岁的彭桓武乡亲，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00002",
      "start_ms": 4470,
      "end_ms": 6690,
      "text": "一眼看上了山东姑娘。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00003",
      "start_ms": 6710,
      "end_ms": 7350,
      "text": "刘秉贤，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00004",
      "start_ms": 8070,
      "end_ms": 9430,
      "text": "他给姑娘写了封信，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00005",
      "start_ms": 10110,
      "end_ms": 11410,
      "text": "先表达心意，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00006",
      "start_ms": 11710,
      "end_ms": 13090,
      "text": "然后话锋一转，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00007",
      "start_ms": 13350,
      "end_ms": 14410,
      "text": "开始列缺点。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00008",
      "start_ms": 15070,
      "end_ms": 16010,
      "text": "我不会做饭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00009",
      "start_ms": 16410,
      "end_ms": 17510,
      "text": "不会洗衣服，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00010",
      "start_ms": 17750,
      "end_ms": 19070,
      "text": "不懂人情世故，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00011",
      "start_ms": 19430,
      "end_ms": 21590,
      "text": "对金钱权利全没兴趣，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00012",
      "start_ms": 21910,
      "end_ms": 22950,
      "text": "这哪是表白，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00013",
      "start_ms": 23330,
      "end_ms": 25650,
      "text": "这分明是劝退我，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00014",
      "start_ms": 25670,
      "end_ms": 27630,
      "text": "一般姑娘早吓跑了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00015",
      "start_ms": 28590,
      "end_ms": 31780,
      "text": "可刘秉贤很快回答回了信几句话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00016",
      "start_ms": 33360,
      "end_ms": 38020,
      "text": "让彭黄武这个一辈子跟物理公式打交道的人红了眼眶。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00017",
      "start_ms": 38480,
      "end_ms": 39680,
      "text": "你不会洗衣服，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00018",
      "start_ms": 39940,
      "end_ms": 42080,
      "text": "我会你不会做饭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00019",
      "start_ms": 42320,
      "end_ms": 44840,
      "text": "我做你不懂人情世故，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00020",
      "start_ms": 44960,
      "end_ms": 48180,
      "text": "我懂你对权力金钱没兴趣，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00021",
      "start_ms": 48460,
      "end_ms": 50280,
      "text": "我也没有你不会的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00022",
      "start_ms": 50800,
      "end_ms": 52380,
      "text": "我来你不爱的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00023",
      "start_ms": 52400,
      "end_ms": 54580,
      "text": "我陪你躲认识两个月，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00024",
      "start_ms": 54820,
      "end_ms": 55660,
      "text": "两人闪婚。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00025",
      "start_ms": 56320,
      "end_ms": 56800,
      "text": "这年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00026",
      "start_ms": 57100,
      "end_ms": 60405,
      "text": "彭黄武、四十三岁、刘炳贤三十六、六岁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00027",
      "start_ms": 60890,
      "end_ms": 62965,
      "text": "婚后的彭黄武相变了个人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00028",
      "start_ms": 63450,
      "end_ms": 64785,
      "text": "以前邋里邋遢，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00029",
      "start_ms": 65250,
      "end_ms": 66615,
      "text": "现在衣服整洁了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00030",
      "start_ms": 66920,
      "end_ms": 68615,
      "text": "以前泡实验室不回家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00031",
      "start_ms": 69100,
      "end_ms": 70395,
      "text": "现在知道往家跑了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00032",
      "start_ms": 70570,
      "end_ms": 73125,
      "text": "刘秉贤包揽所有生活琐事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00033",
      "start_ms": 73730,
      "end_ms": 75465,
      "text": "让他毫无后顾之忧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00034",
      "start_ms": 76040,
      "end_ms": 78135,
      "text": "全心扎进国防科研。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00035",
      "start_ms": 78700,
      "end_ms": 82470,
      "text": "这一过就是十九年十九年里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00036",
      "start_ms": 82650,
      "end_ms": 86455,
      "text": "他把彭怀武照顾的干干净净体体面面，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00037",
      "start_ms": 86940,
      "end_ms": 89595,
      "text": "他在外面撑起国家的核保护伞。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00038",
      "start_ms": 90000,
      "end_ms": 94595,
      "text": "他在家里撑起他的一片天可红颜薄命。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00039",
      "start_ms": 95350,
      "end_ms": 96425,
      "text": "十九年后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00040",
      "start_ms": 96780,
      "end_ms": 98545,
      "text": "刘秉贤骤然离世，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00041",
      "start_ms": 99850,
      "end_ms": 101585,
      "text": "彭黄武躺在床上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00042",
      "start_ms": 102020,
      "end_ms": 105295,
      "text": "整整七天七夜不吃不喝。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00043",
      "start_ms": 106340,
      "end_ms": 107105,
      "text": "七天后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00044",
      "start_ms": 107360,
      "end_ms": 110450,
      "text": "他爬起来干了三件事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00045",
      "start_ms": 110590,
      "end_ms": 113505,
      "text": "第一把妻子照片挂床头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00046",
      "start_ms": 113940,
      "end_ms": 119530,
      "text": "一睁眼就要看到第二把妻子骨灰藏花盆，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00047",
      "start_ms": 119590,
      "end_ms": 120165,
      "text": "深处，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00048",
      "start_ms": 120530,
      "end_ms": 121755,
      "text": "不许任何人碰。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00049",
      "start_ms": 122340,
      "end_ms": 122780,
      "text": "第三，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00050",
      "start_ms": 123520,
      "end_ms": 125045,
      "text": "从此一个人住，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00051",
      "start_ms": 125750,
      "end_ms": 127795,
      "text": "不允许任何人搬进来打扰。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00052",
      "start_ms": 128380,
      "end_ms": 131785,
      "text": "这一首就是三十年。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00053",
      "start_ms": 132990,
      "end_ms": 133975,
      "text": "三十年啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00054",
      "start_ms": 134230,
      "end_ms": 136130,
      "text": "一个生活不能自理的人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00055",
      "start_ms": 136530,
      "end_ms": 137510,
      "text": "妻子走后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00056",
      "start_ms": 137810,
      "end_ms": 138690,
      "text": "自己做饭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00057",
      "start_ms": 138990,
      "end_ms": 140010,
      "text": "自己洗衣，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00058",
      "start_ms": 140270,
      "end_ms": 141605,
      "text": "自己打理一切。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00059",
      "start_ms": 142880,
      "end_ms": 143700,
      "text": "七十六岁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00060",
      "start_ms": 143940,
      "end_ms": 145095,
      "text": "开始学做饭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00061",
      "start_ms": 145570,
      "end_ms": 148175,
      "text": "常常饭烧糊汤煮肝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00062",
      "start_ms": 148590,
      "end_ms": 150190,
      "text": "可从来不请保姆，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00063",
      "start_ms": 150450,
      "end_ms": 151765,
      "text": "也不让人帮忙。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00064",
      "start_ms": 152300,
      "end_ms": 154160,
      "text": "有人劝他找个人照顾，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00065",
      "start_ms": 154160,
      "end_ms": 154945,
      "text": "他摇摇头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00066",
      "start_ms": 155270,
      "end_ms": 156765,
      "text": "这是我们两个人的世界。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00067",
      "start_ms": 157810,
      "end_ms": 160925,
      "text": "第三个人进来就不一样了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00068",
      "start_ms": 161890,
      "end_ms": 164210,
      "text": "他时常对着一张白纸，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00069",
      "start_ms": 164230,
      "end_ms": 165385,
      "text": "跟妻子说话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00070",
      "start_ms": 166100,
      "end_ms": 170285,
      "text": "写着写着就写成了一本书。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00071",
      "start_ms": 170820,
      "end_ms": 174845,
      "text": "你说这得有多深的感情，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00072",
      "start_ms": 175380,
      "end_ms": 181135,
      "text": "才能让一个老人守着一盆骨灰一张照片过三十年。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00073",
      "start_ms": 182090,
      "end_ms": 186715,
      "text": "但彭黄武的很远不止于此。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00074",
      "start_ms": 188210,
      "end_ms": 189265,
      "text": "一九九五年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00075",
      "start_ms": 189790,
      "end_ms": 193625,
      "text": "他获得禾梁合力基金科学与技术成就奖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00076",
      "start_ms": 194200,
      "end_ms": 195935,
      "text": "奖金一百万港币，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00077",
      "start_ms": 196550,
      "end_ms": 198520,
      "text": "九零年代的一百万。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00078",
      "start_ms": 198600,
      "end_ms": 199345,
      "text": "什么概念？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00079",
      "start_ms": 201030,
      "end_ms": 202195,
      "text": "一笔巨款啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00080",
      "start_ms": 203040,
      "end_ms": 204915,
      "text": "当时他身患多种疾病，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00081",
      "start_ms": 205710,
      "end_ms": 208765,
      "text": "有人劝他拿着钱治病吧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00082",
      "start_ms": 209740,
      "end_ms": 210625,
      "text": "身体要紧。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00083",
      "start_ms": 211880,
      "end_ms": 216015,
      "text": "彭欢武怎么说的这钱对我没用处，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00084",
      "start_ms": 216490,
      "end_ms": 220665,
      "text": "然后拿着一百万港币全部捐赠了出去。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00085",
      "start_ms": 221180,
      "end_ms": 223245,
      "text": "设立彭黄武纪念赠款，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00086",
      "start_ms": 223690,
      "end_ms": 227545,
      "text": "从一九九六年到二零零四年九年间，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00087",
      "start_ms": 228090,
      "end_ms": 230245,
      "text": "分批赠给三十五位。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00088",
      "start_ms": 230580,
      "end_ms": 236215,
      "text": "当年一起搞两弹身体受过伤害或生活困难的老同事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00089",
      "start_ms": 236570,
      "end_ms": 238790,
      "text": "别人拿奖金奖励后人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00090",
      "start_ms": 238990,
      "end_ms": 241115,
      "text": "他拿奖金回报同代人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00091",
      "start_ms": 241590,
      "end_ms": 242010,
      "text": "他说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00092",
      "start_ms": 242190,
      "end_ms": 244010,
      "text": "原子弹是集体的功劳，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00093",
      "start_ms": 244310,
      "end_ms": 247530,
      "text": "奖金也是集体的轻飘飘。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00094",
      "start_ms": 247530,
      "end_ms": 248265,
      "text": "一句话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00095",
      "start_ms": 248990,
      "end_ms": 251815,
      "text": "一百万的港币一分都没留，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00096",
      "start_ms": 253480,
      "end_ms": 258215,
      "text": "晚年的彭桓武干了件更让人看不懂的事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00097",
      "start_ms": 258790,
      "end_ms": 262905,
      "text": "他要把自己在人间的痕迹全部擦掉，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00098",
      "start_ms": 263590,
      "end_ms": 265245,
      "text": "推掉各种社会头衔，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00099",
      "start_ms": 266000,
      "end_ms": 268055,
      "text": "谢绝各级领导接见，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00100",
      "start_ms": 268370,
      "end_ms": 269210,
      "text": "不坐专车，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00101",
      "start_ms": 269490,
      "end_ms": 270455,
      "text": "不请保姆，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00102",
      "start_ms": 270950,
      "end_ms": 274135,
      "text": "公交车上没人认得出这老头是谁？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00103",
      "start_ms": 274670,
      "end_ms": 283355,
      "text": "两弹一星功勋奖章捐给中国人民革命军事博物馆、毕生工资积蓄近五十万元，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00104",
      "start_ms": 283720,
      "end_ms": 284820,
      "text": "捐给中科院，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00105",
      "start_ms": 284880,
      "end_ms": 290065,
      "text": "理论物理研究所全部藏书捐给研究所图书馆。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00106",
      "start_ms": 290510,
      "end_ms": 291255,
      "text": "去世前，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00107",
      "start_ms": 291590,
      "end_ms": 292930,
      "text": "他列了张清单，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00108",
      "start_ms": 293850,
      "end_ms": 298680,
      "text": "家里的一本书、一把椅子、一台电脑、一个打印机，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00109",
      "start_ms": 298900,
      "end_ms": 301640,
      "text": "甚至上网号码都一一备注了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00110",
      "start_ms": 301640,
      "end_ms": 302895,
      "text": "该归还到哪里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00111",
      "start_ms": 303320,
      "end_ms": 307305,
      "text": "最后连遗体也捐了捐给医院。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00112",
      "start_ms": 307610,
      "end_ms": 309050,
      "text": "用于医学研究。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00113",
      "start_ms": 310170,
      "end_ms": 314430,
      "text": "二零零七年二月二十八日二十一时四十分，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00114",
      "start_ms": 314490,
      "end_ms": 317010,
      "text": "九十二岁的彭黄武在北京逝世。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00115",
      "start_ms": 317470,
      "end_ms": 318790,
      "text": "他留下的遗嘱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00116",
      "start_ms": 319030,
      "end_ms": 322810,
      "text": "每一个字都戳人心窝丧遗从简，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00117",
      "start_ms": 323130,
      "end_ms": 325690,
      "text": "不举行任何会骨灰不存。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00118",
      "start_ms": 325730,
      "end_ms": 330890,
      "text": "任何公墓要与妻子刘炳贤的骨灰合并规范，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00119",
      "start_ms": 330970,
      "end_ms": 332390,
      "text": "自然不要墓碑，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00120",
      "start_ms": 332450,
      "end_ms": 333290,
      "text": "不要公墓，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00121",
      "start_ms": 333710,
      "end_ms": 334610,
      "text": "不要纪念，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00122",
      "start_ms": 335070,
      "end_ms": 338100,
      "text": "只求和妻子的骨灰混在一在一起，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00123",
      "start_ms": 338440,
      "end_ms": 339520,
      "text": "洒向大自然。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00124",
      "start_ms": 340140,
      "end_ms": 341980,
      "text": "他来的时候一无所有，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00125",
      "start_ms": 342340,
      "end_ms": 344260,
      "text": "走的时候两袖清风，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00126",
      "start_ms": 344880,
      "end_ms": 348200,
      "text": "把自己的一切全部捐给了这个国家。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00127",
      "start_ms": 348720,
      "end_ms": 353120,
      "text": "最后连骨灰都要和最爱的人一起回归，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00128",
      "start_ms": 353140,
      "end_ms": 355200,
      "text": "这片他守护了一生的土地。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00129",
      "start_ms": 355680,
      "end_ms": 356220,
      "text": "如今，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00130",
      "start_ms": 356540,
      "end_ms": 358440,
      "text": "他的名字被刻在天上。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00131",
      "start_ms": 358820,
      "end_ms": 368355,
      "text": "中国科学院国家天文台发现的小行星国际永久编号四八七九八被命名为彭循环五行。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00132",
      "start_ms": 368740,
      "end_ms": 370055,
      "text": "他什么都没留下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00133",
      "start_ms": 370480,
      "end_ms": 374430,
      "text": "只留下了天上的一颗星和戈壁滩上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00134",
      "start_ms": 374450,
      "end_ms": 379555,
      "text": "那朵永远铭刻在中华民族记忆里的蘑菇云。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00135",
      "start_ms": 380140,
      "end_ms": 380755,
      "text": "朋友们，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00136",
      "start_ms": 382260,
      "end_ms": 383395,
      "text": "记住这个名字吧。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00137",
      "start_ms": 383690,
      "end_ms": 384715,
      "text": "滕黄武，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00138",
      "start_ms": 385160,
      "end_ms": 390585,
      "text": "一个能让氢弹爆炸生活却不能自理的两弹元群，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00139",
      "start_ms": 391640,
      "end_ms": 393695,
      "text": "一个对国家倾尽所有，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00140",
      "start_ms": 393970,
      "end_ms": 396920,
      "text": "对妻子忠贞一生的纯粹的人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00141",
      "start_ms": 397240,
      "end_ms": 397895,
      "text": "这束花，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00142",
      "start_ms": 399570,
      "end_ms": 403615,
      "text": "我们替十四亿人送给他。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00143",
      "start_ms": 406470,
      "end_ms": 408025,
      "text": "彭欢武的故事讲完了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00144",
      "start_ms": 408270,
      "end_ms": 409125,
      "text": "但你知道吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00145",
      "start_ms": 409440,
      "end_ms": 412035,
      "text": "像他这样隐姓埋名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00146",
      "start_ms": 412520,
      "end_ms": 413800,
      "text": "为国助盾的人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00147",
      "start_ms": 414020,
      "end_ms": 416530,
      "text": "远不止一个钱学森，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00148",
      "start_ms": 416570,
      "end_ms": 418350,
      "text": "冲破美国五年封锁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00149",
      "start_ms": 418390,
      "end_ms": 419375,
      "text": "毅然回国。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00150",
      "start_ms": 419830,
      "end_ms": 421470,
      "text": "程开甲扎根戈壁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00151",
      "start_ms": 421490,
      "end_ms": 423075,
      "text": "二十八年无人知晓，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00152",
      "start_ms": 423580,
      "end_ms": 426320,
      "text": "林巧志一生结生了五万多个孩子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00153",
      "start_ms": 426320,
      "end_ms": 427720,
      "text": "却自己没当过母亲。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00154",
      "start_ms": 427860,
      "end_ms": 431165,
      "text": "这些人才是我们真正该追的星。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00155",
      "start_ms": 432180,
      "end_ms": 434985,
      "text": "如果你想把这些故事完整的读一遍，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00156",
      "start_ms": 435460,
      "end_ms": 437220,
      "text": "我推荐你看看这本书。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00157",
      "start_ms": 437400,
      "end_ms": 438365,
      "text": "国之几两。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00158",
      "start_ms": 439070,
      "end_ms": 447165,
      "text": "他由环球人物杂志社主编收录了三十多位科学界功勋人物的真实人生，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00159",
      "start_ms": 447880,
      "end_ms": 450785,
      "text": "从两弹一星到航天农业，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00160",
      "start_ms": 451380,
      "end_ms": 453225,
      "text": "从钱学森到袁隆平，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00161",
      "start_ms": 453960,
      "end_ms": 458905,
      "text": "每一位的故事都像彭桓武这样戳人心窝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00162",
      "start_ms": 459610,
      "end_ms": 464915,
      "text": "书里还有大量珍贵的历史老照片和院士亲笔语录。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00163",
      "start_ms": 465510,
      "end_ms": 467830,
      "text": "不是那种干巴巴的人物传记，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00164",
      "start_ms": 467910,
      "end_ms": 474955,
      "text": "是真的能让你读着读着就红了眼眶的那种自己读是一份敬意。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00165",
      "start_ms": 475400,
      "end_ms": 478085,
      "text": "给孩子读是一种传承，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00166",
      "start_ms": 478650,
      "end_ms": 482305,
      "text": "让咱们的下一代知道什么叫真正的英雄。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00167",
      "start_ms": 482910,
      "end_ms": 484605,
      "text": "什么叫国之脊梁？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00168",
      "start_ms": 484990,
      "end_ms": 487125,
      "text": "这本书就在左下角链接里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00169",
      "start_ms": 487470,
      "end_ms": 489570,
      "text": "感兴趣的朋友可以带回去一本，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00170",
      "start_ms": 489570,
      "end_ms": 490490,
      "text": "细细品读，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00171",
      "start_ms": 490950,
      "end_ms": 491610,
      "text": "点个赞，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00172",
      "start_ms": 491930,
      "end_ms": 492810,
      "text": "收藏起来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00173",
      "start_ms": 493090,
      "end_ms": 494210,
      "text": "评论区留一句，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00174",
      "start_ms": 494210,
      "end_ms": 495030,
      "text": "致敬朋友，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00175",
      "start_ms": 495550,
      "end_ms": 497530,
      "text": "再转发给身边的人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00176",
      "start_ms": 498330,
      "end_ms": 498970,
      "text": "关注我。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b46d6662109eb97e_s00177",
      "start_ms": 499470,
      "end_ms": 506415,
      "text": "下一期继续讲那些隐姓埋名为国筑盾的无双国事。"
